        },
        {
          "text": "Izilwane zasendle ziyakungidumisa, izimpungushe nezikhova, ngokuba ngiyakuphuzisa abantu bami abakhethiweyo bami amanzi ehlane nemifula ehlane.",
          "type": "text",
