        },
        {
          "text": "Awungithengelanga umhlanga othaphukayo ngemali, awuzange ungisuthise ngamanoni ezinyama zakho; kepha wangikhonza ngezono zakho, wangidinisa ngobubi bakho.",
          "type": "text",
